
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="E-chatter BGMI Newsroom - BGMI esports की ताज़ा खबरें, टूर्नामेंट, टीम अपडेट और मैच रिजल्ट हिंदी में।">
  <title>BGMI Newsroom | E-chatter</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      background: #100b13;
      color: #f7eff8;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .topbar {
      padding: 20px 7%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #302333;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: #d94a9a;
    }

    .back-link {
      color: #d9cbdc;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 90px 7% 65px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 30%, #542044 0%, transparent 42%),
        linear-gradient(120deg, #180e1d, #100b13);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: #c8f45b;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 88px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -4px;
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .hero h1 span {
      color: #e75aa8;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 580px;
      color: #c8bacb;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .hero-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 10px 17px;
      border: 1px solid #70506d;
      border-radius: 30px;
      color: #d9f78b;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 55px 7% 90px;
      max-width: 1450px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .section-heading {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      font-size: clamp(27px, 4vw, 42px);
    }

    .section-heading p {
      color: #a99aaa;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .categories {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 38px;
    }

    .category {
      padding: 9px 17px;
      border: 1px solid #493447;
      border-radius: 30px;
      color: #e4d7e5;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .category.active {
      background: #d94a9a;
      border-color: #d94a9a;
      color: white;
    }

    .empty-card {
      border: 1px solid #3c293c;
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 55px 25px;
      text-align: center;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #40213d, transparent 65%),
        #19111d;
    }

    .empty-icon {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .empty-card h3 {
      font-size: 27px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .empty-card p {
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: auto;
      color: #b9aabd;
    }

    .footer {
      border-top: 1px solid #302333;
      padding: 25px 7%;
      color: #9f91a2;
      font-size: 13px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .topbar {
        padding: 17px 5%;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 65px 5% 50px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        letter-spacing: -2px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 40px 5% 65px;
      }

      .section-heading {
        display: block;
      }

      .section-heading p {
        margin-top: 7px;
      }

      .footer {
        padding: 22px 5%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header class="topbar">
    <a href="/" class="logo">E<span>-</span>chatter</a>
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to main website</a>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">E-chatter presents · BGMI coverage</div>
    <h1>THE BATTLEGROUND.<br><span>THE STORIES.</span></h1>
    <p>
      BGMI esports की दुनिया से जुड़ी खबरें, टूर्नामेंट,
      टीम अपडेट और मैच रिजल्ट — आसान हिंदी में।
    </p>
    <div class="hero-tag">🎮 सिर्फ BGMI · हिंदी में</div>
  </section>

  <main class="content">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Stay in the game</div>
        <h2>Latest BGMI News</h2>
      </div>
      <p>आपकी BGMI दुनिया, एक ही जगह।</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="categories" aria-label="News categories">
      <span class="category active">सभी खबरें</span>
      <span class="category">ताज़ा खबरें</span>
      <span class="category">टूर्नामेंट</span>
      <span class="category">टीम और रोस्टर</span>
      <span class="category">मैच रिजल्ट</span>
      <span class="category">खिलाड़ी</span>
      <span class="category">विश्लेषण</span>
    </nav>

    <section class="empty-card">
      <div class="empty-icon">🎯</div>
      <h3>पहली रिपोर्ट जल्द आ रही है!</h3>
      <p>
        हमारी टीम BGMI esports की खबरों को तैयार कर रही है।
        जल्द ही यहाँ पहली रिपोर्ट पढ़ने को मिलेगी।
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <span>© 2026 E-chatter. Dream. Design. Deliver.</span>
    <a href="/">Visit E-chatter →</a>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
